---
permalink: /lab/
world: lab
title: LAB
description: OKstyle LAB — IoT・ものづくり・360°VR の観測と実験の記録。
---
{%- set labPosts = collections.articles | byWorld("lab") %}
<section class="world-hero world-hero--lab">
  <div class="container world-hero__inner">
    <img class="world-hero__logo" src="{{ worlds.lab.logo | url }}" width="180" height="180" alt="LAB ロゴ">
    <div>
      <p class="world-hero__kicker">{{ worlds.lab.kicker }}</p>
      <h1 class="world-hero__title">LAB</h1>
      <p class="world-hero__catch">{{ worlds.lab.catch }}</p>
      <p class="world-hero__lead">{{ worlds.lab.lead }}</p>
      <p class="world-hero__stat"><span>{{ labPosts.length }}</span> 件の観測ログ</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container" aria-labelledby="lab-sections">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 id="lab-sections" class="section-head__title">実験区画</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="entry-grid">
    {%- for sec in worlds.labSections %}
    {%- set secPosts = labPosts | bySection(sec.slug) %}
    <a class="entry-tile entry-tile--lab" href="{{ ('/lab/' + sec.slug + '/') | url }}">
      <span class="entry-tile__no">{{ "0" + loop.index }}</span>
      <span class="entry-tile__en">{{ sec.en }}</span>
      <span class="entry-tile__name">{{ sec.name }}</span>
      <span class="entry-tile__desc">{{ sec.description }}</span>
      <span class="entry-tile__count">{{ secPosts.length }} 件</span>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container" aria-labelledby="lab-latest">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 id="lab-latest" class="section-head__title">最新の観測</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {%- for item in labPosts | head(12) %}
    {% include "partials/card.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container" aria-labelledby="lab-all">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 id="lab-all" class="section-head__title">観測ログ一覧</h2>
    <span class="section-head__note">古い記事も含めた LAB の全記事</span>
  </div>
  {%- set listPosts = labPosts | skip(12) %}
  {% include "partials/post-list.njk" %}
</section>
